entities 
- User
  - id, name, email, avatarUrl, createdAt
- Project
  - Represents a Kanban workspace/board.
  - id, name, description, createdBy, createdAt
- ProjectMember
  - Joins users to projects and stores permissions.
  - projectId, userId, role (owner, admin, member, viewer)
- Column / TaskStatus
  - The project’s workflow stages: To-Do, In Progress, Done.
  - id, projectId, name, position
- Task
  - Individual Kanban card.
  - id, projectId, columnId, title, description, priority, dueDate, position, createdBy, timestamps
- TaskAssignment
  - Connects tasks to one or more users.
  - taskId, userId, assignedAt
- Label
  - id, projectId, name, color